From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] quartz: add the IAMCollection, IFilterInfo, IPinInfo and IMediaTypeInfo objects

New filterinfo.c with the automation objects described by the DirectShow
control interfaces: a snapshot IAMCollection (Count, zero-based Item with
E_INVALIDARG out of range, _NewEnum as an IEnumVARIANT of IDispatch), IFilterInfo
(FindPin, Name, VendorInfo, Filter, Pins, IsFileSource, Filename get/put),
IPinInfo (Pin, ConnectedTo, ConnectionMediaType, FilterInfo, Name, Direction,
PinID, MediaTypes, Connect, ConnectDirect, ConnectWithType, Disconnect, Render
through the owning graph) and IMediaTypeInfo (major type and subtype as GUID
strings). IDispatch goes through the QuartzTypeLib. Not yet reachable from
IMediaControl.
---
diff --git a/dlls/quartz/Makefile.in b/dlls/quartz/Makefile.in
index 6eeeac9..15d8ccc 100644
--- a/dlls/quartz/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/quartz/Makefile.in
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@ SOURCES = \
 	decoder.c \
 	dsoundrender.c \
 	filesource.c \
+	filterinfo.c \
 	filtergraph.c \
 	filtermapper.c \
 	main.c \
diff --git a/dlls/quartz/filterinfo.c b/dlls/quartz/filterinfo.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..916866d
--- /dev/null
